# One call, end to end
# caption: What it settles. The order of operations for the pilot. Identity is fixed at step 5, the Interaction exists at step 7 before anyone is offered the call, guidance is pinned at step 10 and never changes for that call, and the legacy submission row still appears at step 16 so today's reports and billing keep working.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant Tw as Twilio (client DID)
    participant In as Ingress function
    participant Core as Core /v1
    participant TR as TaskRouter
    participant A as Assist desktop
    participant P as Legacy Portal tables
    C->>Tw: dials client's number
    Tw->>In: voice webhook (signed)
    In->>In: validate X-Twilio-Signature, replay check
    In->>Core: channel-endpoints?e164= (C3)
    Core-->>In: organization_id, service_unit_id
    In->>Core: create Interaction with provider refs (C4)
    Core-->>In: interaction_id
    In->>TR: enqueue with canonical attributes
    TR-->>A: reservation for eligible worker
    A->>A: pop, pin guidance release (C1/C2)
    A->>Core: attach by provider ref
    A->>TR: accept, conference
    Note over A: local WASAPI capture feeds the AI engine
    A->>Core: guidance context + probing responses (C6)
    A->>Core: complete Interaction, outcome v2 (C7)
    Core->>P: compatibility adapter writes call_submissions
    Tw->>Core: recording callback keyed on ConferenceSid (T3)
    Core->>P: recording_groups + billing review
  